WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am&nbsp;
going to explain an American science&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:15.920
fiction action film called “Logan's Run.”&nbsp;
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:21.920
The premise of the movie is set in the year 2274.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:28.320
The world has been torn down by a holocaust and&nbsp;
the surviving humans live in a utopian domed city.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:33.680
The city inhabits an idyllic society where&nbsp;
there is little to no work and people are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:39.200
free to pursue all of the pleasures of life. The&nbsp;
residents of the city are governed by computerized&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:45.520
servo-mechanisms and there are no human leaders.&nbsp;
The computer takes care of all aspects of life,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:52.160
including reproduction, as no humans are allowed&nbsp;
to reproduce sexually. However, there is a catch;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:58.080
a person can only live up to thirty years of&nbsp;
age before undergoing the rite of "Carrousel"&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:03.360
and being terminated. The computerized&nbsp;
Servo-mechanisms enforced this rule to manage&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:07.840
the population and keep it constant. But they&nbsp;
have made the residents believe that the people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:13.120
who are terminated in the Carrousel are actually&nbsp;
“renewed” and brought back to life as babies.
&nbsp;

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.880
Some people called the runners have caught up&nbsp;
to the fact that they are being lied to by the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:26.480
computers. To stop them from running away from&nbsp;
the city, elite policemen called the sandmen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:31.840
are appointed. To track people’s age, each&nbsp;
person is implanted with a "life-clock" crystal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:37.520
in the palm of the left hand at birth. The life&nbsp;
clock changes color as they get older and begins&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:44.080
blinking as they approach their "Last Day.” The&nbsp;
protagonist of the movie is a sandman named Logan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:50.640
5, but unlike the usual sandmen, he is curious&nbsp;
and questioning in nature. In the opening scene,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:56.960
Logan 5 is in a laboratory looking at artificially&nbsp;
born infants. One of them is named Logan 6, who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.960 --> 00:02:02.880
he donated sperm for. His friend and colleague,&nbsp;
Francis 7 brings him out and takes him to that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:07.360
month’s Carrousel event. Several people who&nbsp;
have reached the age of thirty are going to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:12.800
terminated and a crowd has gathered to witness the&nbsp;
rite. It is noticeable that the people are wearing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:19.120
either red, yellow or green clothes, indicating&nbsp;
their ages, red; for the older ones, green is for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:24.960
the middle aged and yellow is for the teenagers.&nbsp;
The sandmen wear their usual black uniform. 
&nbsp;

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:30.480
At the beginning of the ceremony, some masked&nbsp;
people in white gowns are brought to the arena&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:36.320
and circled around a giant lotus. Following that,&nbsp;
the platform they are on begins to move around&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:42.240
creating a zero gravity zone. The masked people&nbsp;
float in the air and are killed one after another&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:47.680
as the crowd cheers. When the rite is almost&nbsp;
over, the sandmen are alerted about a runner&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:52.640
trying to escape from the west entrance. They&nbsp;
chase him across the facility and eventually&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.640 --> 00:02:58.320
shoot him off a balcony. Logan 5 scans the&nbsp;
man’s face and does a quick identity check.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:03.360
Before leaving, he confiscates the runner’s&nbsp;
belongings that include a small metal ankh.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:09.600
The abandoned dead body is then vaporized by a&nbsp;
modern device. Logan 5 is confused why the man&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:14.880
didn’t renew instead of trying to run away&nbsp;
but his friend Francis 7 dismisses it. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:19.680
sandmen are given lavish apartments and are&nbsp;
considered the elites of the new society.
&nbsp;

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:25.120
Logan 7 is in his apartment drinking at the end of&nbsp;
the day. By pressing a button, he summons a girl&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:30.800
for his pleasure. The girl is named Jessica&nbsp;
6 and is fascinated by Logan’s apartment.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:36.240
He gets her to the sofa and tries to kiss her,&nbsp;
but Jessica rejects him. She doesn’t want to get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:41.600
close to him because she is grieving the death&nbsp;
of a friend who was terminated that day. Logan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:46.960
dismisses her concerns stating that her friend was&nbsp;
just renewed, but Jessica scoffs at the comment,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:52.400
claiming that Carrousels are deaths, not renewals.&nbsp;
Logan gets suspicious of her being a runner and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:57.840
inquires about her age. Jessica quickly proves&nbsp;
that she is young by showing him her life clock&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:03.680
that hasn’t turned red yet. They are interrupted&nbsp;
by Francis who arrives with two girls in his arms,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:07.600
looking to have fun. Jessica quickly&nbsp;
rushes out of the apartment saying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:11.840
that she shouldn’t have been summoned. 
The following day, Logan goes to the sandmen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.840 --> 00:04:16.960
headquarters to report the confiscated objects&nbsp;
from yesterday. There, he finds out that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:21.680
ankh is a special key that the runners use to&nbsp;
get to their secret hiding place called the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:27.280
Sanctuary. The computer informs him that over&nbsp;
one thousand runners are on loose currently&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:32.720
and instructs him to catch them all. A confused&nbsp;
Logan asks the computer how many of the runners&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:38.400
have been renewed. He begins to suspect that the&nbsp;
renewal program is fraud when the computer doesn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:45.040
answer. Instead, it orders Logan to be a runner&nbsp;
in disguise and help them catch the others. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:49.760
retaliates again, claiming that the life clock&nbsp;
on his palm will give away the disguise. To his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:55.040
surprise, the computer removes his remaining four&nbsp;
years of life so people would believe he is a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.040 --> 00:05:01.680
runner. Logan protests but it goes in vain because&nbsp;
the computer turns itself off. Now he only has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:07.760
some days to live and a mission in his hands. 
He returns home and summons Jessica again,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.760 --> 00:05:13.040
believing that she knows something about running.&nbsp;
He tells her he has only some days to live and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:18.000
shows her the ankh that is identical to the one&nbsp;
she is wearing around her neck. Jessica accuses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:22.480
him of killing a runner for the ankh and storms&nbsp;
out, believing that Logan is setting up some&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:27.600
kind of trap. It is revealed that she is a part&nbsp;
of the runner group herself when she tells her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:33.360
friends that Logan knows about the Sanctuary. They&nbsp;
order Jessica to finish Logan once and for all.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:38.240
She brings Logan down to the arcade, but before&nbsp;
she can kill him, he is informed of another&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:44.000
runner. They two get into a vehicle and chase the&nbsp;
runner. They end up in an area filled with “cubs”,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:49.520
people who are deemed unfit to live in the main&nbsp;
complex because of their wild nature. The cubs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:54.880
circle the two, intending to rob and kill them.&nbsp;
But Logan uses his weapon to chase them away.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.440 --> 00:06:00.160
Next, Logan uses his scanner to scan the&nbsp;
area and locate the runner they were looking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:05.600
for. He finds her within seconds but instead of&nbsp;
arresting her, he lets her go out of sympathy.
&nbsp;

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:10.160
Because of this, Jessica drops her plan&nbsp;
to kill him and starts to believe he is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:15.680
genuinely a good person. As the two continue&nbsp;
their journey to the Sanctuary, we see Francis&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:21.360
kill the runner they just spared. He now has seen&nbsp;
Logan and Jessica get out of the cube’s zone.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:26.560
Knowing that the sandman will eventually catch&nbsp;
him, Logan goes to a medical professional to get a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:32.640
facelift to disguise himself. However, during the&nbsp;
procedure, the doctor gets a call from the sandmen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:38.800
and turns against Logan. He pushes some buttons&nbsp;
and uses his face lifting device to attack him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:44.160
Logan reacts quickly and manages to avoid the&nbsp;
machine’s attack. Francis arrives at the clinic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:49.360
and gets into a fight with him but Logan&nbsp;
and Jessica somehow manage to escape. Then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:49.360 --> 00:06:54.160
they run to a tunnel and meet the other runners&nbsp;
on their way. Jessica’s friends do not trust&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:59.840
Logan because a Sandman turning into a runner&nbsp;
is unheard of. But they agree to let them go on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:04.080
when a nurse from the clinic earlier&nbsp;
confirms that Logan is on their side.
&nbsp;

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:08.640
The two are told to follow the tunnel to&nbsp;
reach the Sanctuary. Right then, a group of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:14.480
Sandmen arrives with their guns blazing. The duo&nbsp;
manages to run away but is followed by Francis.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:20.320
They eventually reach a door that requires the&nbsp;
ankh to open it. Jessica tries to get hers from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.320 --> 00:07:25.680
her necklace but it falls into the water and&nbsp;
gets lost. Logan quickly uses his one to open&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:30.960
the door and go to the other side. When Francis&nbsp;
comes following them, he finds Jessica’s ankh&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:37.280
and continues the pursuit. Meanwhile, the duo is&nbsp;
lifted up by a machine to a frozen cave. They are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:43.360
approached by an AI robot called the Box, whose&nbsp;
job is to capture food from the outside world to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:49.360
feed the city. The robot is about to freeze them&nbsp;
into food but Logan uses his gun to fight him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:54.480
Eventually, the cave starts to fall apart and&nbsp;
the two run into the outside world. They are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:58.960
mesmerized by the beautiful scenery in front&nbsp;
of them. They have been so brainwashed by the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.960 --> 00:08:04.720
computers that they don’t even know what the sun&nbsp;
is and call it a “hot ball”. After walking for a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.720 --> 00:08:10.080
while they sit down to take a rest, unknown that&nbsp;
Francis has followed them outside as well. 
&nbsp;

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:16.240
The next day, Jessica and Logan are tired of&nbsp;
walking and are still looking for the Sanctuary.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:21.680
They eventually reach a pond and decide to take a&nbsp;
swim. Jessica finally gives into Logan’s efforts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:26.400
and the two make out. They also see that&nbsp;
Logan’s life clock has stopped flickering,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:31.760
meaning that the clock doesn’t work in the outside&nbsp;
world, and they can live for as long as they want.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:37.760
Later that day, they notice a tower and happily&nbsp;
approach it, thinking it is the sanctuary. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:42.000
they are soon met with disappointment to see&nbsp;
the tower and the buildings around it have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:47.520
been taken over by nature. Suddenly, a cat&nbsp;
brushes over Jessica’s leg, startling her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:56.960
The couple is fascinated to see an animal for the&nbsp;
first time. They follow it and reach a classroom&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:56.960 --> 00:09:02.480
with an old man inside. They both are amazed by&nbsp;
his wrinkles and grey hair as they have never&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:07.440
seen a person that old in the city. The man says&nbsp;
that he has been living there since the holocaust&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:12.400
and didn’t even know that the city existed. 
The duo also learns that the old man was raised&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:17.360
by his parents, unlike the residents from the&nbsp;
city who are made in a laboratory and raised in a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:23.760
nursery. Suddenly, Francis arrives there and holds&nbsp;
Jessica hostage. Holding her at gunpoint, he asks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:23.760 --> 00:09:29.280
Logan to get closer so he could terminate him. But&nbsp;
Logan manages to divert his attention by asking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:37.840
him to look at his palm. Francis is as surprised&nbsp;
as the others to see his life clock not blinking.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:43.360
But even then, he doesn’t want to believe he has&nbsp;
been lied to his whole life. He attacks Logan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:49.040
and the two get into a fight. The struggle ends&nbsp;
when Logan manages to wound Francis gravely by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:54.720
hitting him with a pole. Logan then holds his old&nbsp;
friend in his arms and wishes him goodbye as he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:54.720 --> 00:10:00.960
dies. Following that, the old man makes the couple&nbsp;
bury Francis’s body in a grave. He claims that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:05.680
buried his parents around the same area because&nbsp;
that is what humans are supposed to do. 
&nbsp;

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:10.400
Logan wants to go back to the city to show&nbsp;
the people there is so much more to life than&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:15.520
artificial lighting and dying at thirty. He thinks&nbsp;
that the residents will believe him if he shows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:15.520 --> 00:10:21.040
them the old man as proof. The next day, the three&nbsp;
of them leave for the city. While resting on the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:32.240
way, the old man explains the concept of marriage&nbsp;
and family to them. They eventually reach a hydro&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:37.760
plant that supplies water to the city. Logan asks&nbsp;
the old man to wait for them for as long as he can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:37.760 --> 00:10:42.960
before the couple jumps into the water and swims&nbsp;
back to the city. Logan finally tells the people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:42.960 --> 00:10:48.400
about the outside world, but no one cares. The&nbsp;
only people who hear them are the sandmen who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:53.680
arrest them. Logan is taken to an interrogation&nbsp;
room where the computer asks him if he found the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:59.040
Sanctuary. When he doesn’t answer, they use a&nbsp;
technique called surrogation to look into his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:05.120
subconsciousness and download data from his mind.&nbsp;
However, the vast knowledge of the outside world&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:09.520
is too much information for the computer to&nbsp;
process and it starts to malfunction. 
&nbsp;

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:17.440
Everything controlled by the computer starts&nbsp;
to explode, including the facility they are in.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:28.560
The city is ruined, making the people run&nbsp;
outside in fear. As the domes are destroyed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:33.680
the people are introduced to the outside world&nbsp;
for the first time. They see the old man and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:39.280
are amazed by his wrinkles like Jessica was. They&nbsp;
surround him, asking if they can touch his skin.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:43.920
The movie ends as Jessica and Logan&nbsp;
wave at the man from the crowd,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:43.920 --> 00:11:48.640
indicating a happy ending. 
